1
00:00:00,005 --> 00:00:02,735
(chuckles):
And-and here we are.

2
00:00:10,449 --> 00:00:12,479
(Amy:)So, Sheldon and Bernadette
are hanging out.

3
00:00:12,484 --> 00:00:15,854
(Howard:)I know. What are they
gonna talk about?

4
00:00:15,854 --> 00:00:17,324
(laughs)

5
00:00:17,322 --> 00:00:19,422
(Bernadette:)I don't know.

6
00:00:19,424 --> 00:00:22,794
(Amy:)I really don't know.

7
00:00:22,794 --> 00:00:23,724
(Penny:)Hey.

8
00:00:23,729 --> 00:00:25,299
Oh, good!
Oh, thank God!

9
00:00:25,297 --> 00:00:27,567
(Penny:)You guys been here long?

10
00:00:27,566 --> 00:00:28,596
(Howard:)No, two minutes.

11
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:31,400
(Amy:)But yes.

12
00:00:31,403 --> 00:00:32,433
(Howard:)Where's Claire?

13
00:00:32,437 --> 00:00:33,867
(Raj:)Oh, she's meeting us here.

14
00:00:33,872 --> 00:00:36,142
Hey, guys, do me a favor
and don't ask too many questions

15
00:00:36,141 --> 00:00:37,111
(Raj:)about the relationship.

16
00:00:37,109 --> 00:00:38,679
(Raj:)We're just keeping it casual.

17
00:00:38,677 --> 00:00:41,407
(Leonard:)Oh, so I shouldn't ask her
how she feels about being

18
00:00:41,413 --> 00:00:43,583
(Leonard:)a member of your harem?

19
00:00:43,582 --> 00:00:46,652
(Raj:)Yeah, I know you're teasing,
but watch out for karma.

20
00:00:46,651 --> 00:00:49,381
(Amy:)Hey, Penny, isn't that
your old boyfriend Zack?

21
00:00:49,387 --> 00:00:51,457
(Howard:)Oh, yeah.

22
00:00:51,456 --> 00:00:52,926
(Amy:)Are you gonna
say hi to him?

23
00:00:52,924 --> 00:00:54,054
(Penny:)Uh, I don't know.

24
00:00:54,059 --> 00:00:55,059
(Raj:)Hey, while you decide,

25
00:00:55,060 --> 00:00:56,330
who was better in bed:

26
00:00:56,328 --> 00:01:01,018
(Raj:)big hot Zack
or wheezy little Leonard?

